  "thag1.18:0.4": "Siṅgālapituttheragāthā ",
  "thag1.18:1.1": "“Ahu buddhassa dāyādo, ",
  "thag1.18:1.2": "bhikkhu bhesakaḷāvane; ",
  "thag1.18:1.3": "Kevalaṃ aṭṭhisaññāya, ",
  "thag1.18:1.4": "apharī pathaviṃ imaṃ; ",
  "thag1.18:1.5": "Maññehaṃ kāmarāgaṃ so, ",
  "thag1.18:1.6": "khippameva pahissatī”ti. … ",
  "thag1.18:1.7": "Siṅgālapitā thero… . "
}
